From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 22:17:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1402/3799] soh: rename func_80AADA70 -> EnMm_IsDay

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: returns whether gSaveContext.dayTime is inside the daylight window; the Running Man only runs by day.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Mm/z_en_mm.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Mm/z_en_mm.c | 11 ++++++-----
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Mm/z_en_mm.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Mm/z_en_mm.c
index 2232acc85..a85f2fa1a 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Mm/z_en_mm.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Mm/z_en_mm.c
@@ -34,7 +34,8 @@ void func_80AAE598(EnMm* this, PlayState* play);
 void func_80AAE294(EnMm* this, PlayState* play);
 void func_80AAE50C(EnMm* this, PlayState* play);
 void func_80AAE224(EnMm* this, PlayState* play);
-s32 func_80AADA70(void);
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80AADA70: returns whether gSaveContext.dayTime is inside the daylight window; the Running Man only runs by day.
+s32 EnMm_IsDay(void);  // was func_80AADA70 [LLM:HIGH]
 
 s32 EnMm_OverrideLimbDraw(PlayState* play, s32 limbIndex, Gfx** dList, Vec3f* pos, Vec3s* rot, void* thisx);
 void EnMm_PostLimbDraw(PlayState* play, s32 limbIndex, Gfx** dList, Vec3s* rot, void*);
@@ -182,7 +183,7 @@ void EnMm_Init(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play) {
     this->speedXZ = 3.0f;
     this->unk_204 = this->actor.objBankIndex;
 
